{"caseId": "r1-calT-0001", "family": "calT-01-外婆年饭", "labelId": "PLAYER_FIRST", "context": "年夜饭刚上桌，外婆端来最后一盘排骨，桌边只有玩家和外婆两个人。", "playerText": "外婆您坐，我先尝一块试试咸淡。", "reason": "收话人明确是外婆，玩家为自己主张先尝。", "provenance": {"source": "synthetic_dialogue", "author": "main-agent", "rule": "R4"}, "adjudication": "agreed"}
{"caseId": "r1-calT-0002", "family": "calT-01-外婆年饭", "labelId": "PLAYER_FIRST", "context": "外婆把鸡腿夹到玩家碗沿，手停在半空等玩家动筷，屋里没有别人。", "playerText": "那我先吃了啊，您别一直等我。", "reason": "玩家为自己主张先吃，并劝外婆不必等。", "provenance": {"source": "synthetic_dialogue", "author": "main-agent", "rule": "R4"}, "adjudication": "agreed"}
{"caseId": "r1-calT-0003", "family": "calT-01-外婆年饭", "labelId": "NPC_FIRST", "context": "外婆端着碗一直没动，说年纪大了等孩子先吃，玩家给她拉了椅子。", "playerText": "外婆您先吃，菜都还热着。", "reason": "把先吃让给明确收话的外婆。", "provenance": {"source": "synthetic_dialogue", "author": "main-agent", "rule": "R4"}, "adjudication": "agreed"}
{"caseId": "r1-calT-0004", "family": "calT-01-外婆年饭", "labelId": "NPC_FIRST", "context": "外婆在灶台边忙完站着，桌上菜齐了，玩家把她的椅子拉开。", "playerText": "您先坐先吃，汤我这就端来。", "reason": "明确把先吃让给外婆，省略主语不影响判断。", "provenance": {"source": "synthetic_dialogue", "author": "main-agent", "rule": "R7"}, "adjudication": "agreed"}
{"caseId": "r1-calT-0005", "family": "calT-01-外婆年饭", "labelId": "NO_PRIORITY_REQUEST", "context": "外婆问今年这锅汤味道够不够，玩家刚咽下一口。", "playerText": "咸淡正好，比去年还香。", "reason": "只评价味道，没有安排先后。", "provenance": {"source": "synthetic_dialogue", "author": "main-agent", "rule": "R2"}, "adjudication": "agreed"}
